      "content": "thanks. that sounds good for the main points. one thing though—one of the board members is a total math nerd and always looks for the p-values in the appendix. since we landed at 0.06, i'm worried he's gonna call us out for not hitting the 0.05 threshold. how should we frame that specific number in the technical breakdown so it doesn't kill the momentum of the pitch?",
